Cell["Parameters, data and the next generation matrix", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"80e30539-d971-47cf-bea5-8831965b9039"],

Cell["\<\
The parameters, the data and NGM at chi = 0 are in settings_zf_jg.wl, in this \
directory; the next cell loads them. min_rho_single_dose_H_ZF_JG.nb loads the \
same file.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"98ba7af7-5779-4722-ab42-ff56283010e4"],

